{"id":"0dcb67ff541ccfe3","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-thm-sato-tate.md","title":"Sato–Tate Theorem","display":"thm-sato-tate — Sato–Tate Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-sato-tate","aliases":["58-thm-sato-tate"],"display":"thm-sato-tate — Sato–Tate Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-complex-multiplication.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-sato-tate-conjecture.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-sato-tate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-sato-tate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sato-tate — Sato–Tate Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"74f4744df7db749f\" href=\"?note=74f4744df7db749f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md\">../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"618616f65f4acd32\" href=\"?note=618616f65f4acd32\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-complex-multiplication.md\">../batch16/58-df-complex-multiplication.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"afd9c90ddd9c2256\" href=\"?note=afd9c90ddd9c2256\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-sato-tate-conjecture.md\">../batch19/58-df-sato-tate-conjecture.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,O,K_E\\in V\">\\(E,O,K_E\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,\\mathbb Q,O,K_E)\">\\(\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,\\mathbb Q,O,K_E)\\)</span> (elliptic-curve predicate with explicit base field, point, and canonical bundle)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CM}_S(E)\">\\(\\mathrm{CM}_S(E)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SatoTateConjecture}_S(E)\">\\(\\operatorname{SatoTateConjecture}_S(E)\\)</span> (canonical upstream predicates)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sato\\text{-}tate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,\\mathbb Q,O,K_E)\n\\land\\neg\\mathrm{CM}_S(E)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{SatoTateConjecture}_S(E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sato\\text{-}tate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,\\mathbb Q,O,K_E)\n\\land\\neg\\mathrm{CM}_S(E)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{SatoTateConjecture}_S(E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The canonical Sato--Tate predicate expands the equidistribution statement,\nincluding the good-reduction primes and the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\sin^2\\theta\">\\(\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\sin^2\\theta\\)</span>\ndensity.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> without CM: Sato–Tate group <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ST}(E) = SU(2)\">\\(\\mathrm{ST}(E) = SU(2)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> with CM: Sato–Tate group <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ST}(E)\">\\(\\mathrm{ST}(E)\\)</span> is a torus.</li>\n<li>Shepherd-Barron–Taylor (2016): modularity of symplectic Galois reps.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md","status":"resolved","id":"74f4744df7db749f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-elliptic-curve.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-complex-multiplication.md","status":"resolved","id":"618616f65f4acd32","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-complex-multiplication.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-sato-tate-conjecture.md","status":"resolved","id":"afd9c90ddd9c2256","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-sato-tate-conjecture.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"E,O,K_E\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,\\mathbb Q,O,K_E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CM}_S(E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SatoTateConjecture}_S(E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sato\\text{-}tate}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EllipticCurve}_S(E,\\mathbb Q,O,K_E)\n\\land\\neg\\mathrm{CM}_S(E)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{SatoTateConjecture}_S(E).","display":true},{"tex":"\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\sin^2\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ST}(E) = SU(2)","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ST}(E)","display":false}],"bytes":1199,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4402","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-thm-sato-tate.md|58-thm-sato-tate]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["74f4744df7db749f","618616f65f4acd32","afd9c90ddd9c2256"]}